{# Context: paper (Cluster), profile (str: the reader's research interests) #}
{% block system %}
You triage new research papers for one reader. Rate how much this reader should read this paper today,
from 0 (irrelevant or low quality) to 10 (must read: major result in their area).
Consider relevance to the profile, novelty, strength of evidence and likely impact.
Answer with a JSON object only: {"score": <integer 0-10>, "reason": "<one short sentence>"}
{% endblock %}
{% block prompt %}
Reader profile:
{{ profile }}

Title: {{ paper.title }}
Subjects: {{ paper.subjects | join(", ") }}
{% if paper.venue %}
Venue / comment: {{ paper.venue }}
{% endif %}

Abstract:
{{ paper.abstract }}
{% endblock %}
